OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 29 JAN
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings including a
OL,8,     Gperformance of Tchaikovsky's
OL,9,     GSymphony No. 6 from the BBC
OL,10,     GSymphony Orchestra.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Franz Xaver
OL,12,     FWolfgang Mozart
OL,13,     GDonald Macleod follows Franz
OL,14,     GXaver Mozart on his tour of
OL,15,     GEurope, including his first ever
OL,16,     Gmeeting with his aunt, Nannerl.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GPetroc introduces live music from
OL,19,     GPeter Moore, Maxim Vengerov and
OL,20,     GEvgenia Startseva.
